{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月21日 15:01 星期六</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月21日 16:13 星期六</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（21日）清晨5時許，警方接報青山公路荃灣段623號韻濤居B座一個住宅單位發生火警，消防到場將火救熄。單位內40歲男住戶吸入濃煙不適，清醒由救護車送往仁濟醫院治理。另外，消防員在起火單位發現一具貓屍。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>火警期間有數十人自行疏散，同層一名男子逃生期間被飼養的貓抓傷，經包紮後毋需送院。消防初步調查後，相信單位內暖風機起火，波及牀褥、被鋪，初步相信火警起因無可疑。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕火警 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.179656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:01:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:33.472795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:27.335325+00:00","content_hash":"e5ccbc1b066f4ada6690b054b87a3708b2ad4b9462ddb979fd2aec16b0c15c92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}